    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Default <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> implementation with Prometheus <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> v2 API integration.</para>
<para>When enabled, sends alerts via HTTP POST to the Prometheus <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> REST API (/api/v2/alerts and /api/v2/silences). Supports retry-on-failure and connection health-checks. When disabled, alerts are logged locally only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
